The annual meeting of the LLG has been held by email since 2005, and the membership of the LLG agreed that after 2007, this practice would be continued. The email record, which since 2007 has been deemed to satisfy the requirement for minutes, is available to members in the [http://mail.lojban.org/mailman/private/llg-members|archives]. Since the transition from formal minutes, there have been repeated requests for summaries of proceedings, but to date, only one such summary has been published, for the 2009 meeting. It was accepted as minutes according to the proceedings of the 2010 meeting.



!!!Summaries

!!!!Email meetings

* 2013: ((LLG Meeting Topics 2013|Annual Meeting)) from January 19 - March 21, 2014

* 2012: ((LLG Meeting Topics 2012|Annual Meeting)) from October 26 - December 11, 2012

* 2011: Meeting conducted via llg-members from October 9 - November 14, 2011 (summary forthcoming)

* 2010: ((LLG Meeting Topics 2010|Annual Meeting)) called to Order August 21, 2010 (proposed agenda only, no record of proceedings)

!!!Minutes

!!!!Email meetings

* 2009: ((LLG 2009 Annual Meeting Minutes|Annual Meeting)) Called to order August 8, 2009 (conducted via llg-members) 

* 2008: No record of meeting, probably January or February, 2008

* 2007: ((LLG 2007 Annual Meeting Minutes|Annual Meeting)), Called to order October 6, 2007 (conducted via llg-members)

* 2006: ((LLG 2006 Annual Meeting Minutes|Annual Meeting)), Called to order July 7, 2006 (conducted via llg-members)

* 2005: ((LLG 2005 Annual Meeting Minutes|Annual Meeting)), Called to order November 15, 2005 (conducted via llg-members)

!!!!IRC meetings

* 2004: ((LLG 2004 Annual Meeting Minutes|Annual Meeting)), Called to order July 7, 2004 (conducted via irc.lojban.org #llg)

* 2003: ((LLG 2003 Annual Meeting Minutes|Annual Meeting)), June 15 and 29, July 6, 2003 (conducted via irc.lojban.org #meeting)

